WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.530
"We can't let Zork's team win," Ben told his teammates.

2
00:00:07.531 --> 00:00:14.521
"We'll do better in the next two events—the slime ball toss and the cross-country race," Deb said.

3
00:00:14.522 --> 00:00:18.533
"I'm a good runner, even without kangaroo feet."

4
00:00:18.534 --> 00:00:23.383
"Me too," Mog said. "I think I can outrun Zork."

5
00:00:23.384 --> 00:00:26.321
"You were beating him in the sack race," Ben said.

6
00:00:26.322 --> 00:00:31.961
He suddenly remembered something.

7
00:00:31.962 --> 00:00:36.387
"What did you whisper to Zork just before the race started? It seemed to spook him."

8
00:00:36.388 --> 00:00:40.106
Mog laughed. "I wanted to rattle him.

9
00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.445
So I said, 'Don't trip over your own tail.'"

10
00:00:44.446 --> 00:00:50.716
"And he did trip over his tail!" Jen said.

11
00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:55.603
"Too bad we didn't win though," Mog said ruefully.

12
00:00:55.604 --> 00:00:58.631
*** Soon everybody was back on the

13
00:00:58.632 --> 00:01:06.337
field. The two teams stood opposite each other a short distance

14
00:01:06.338 --> 00:01:13.242
apart. "The slime ball toss ends when all three players on one team are out," Mr. Gwarg

15
00:01:13.243 --> 00:01:20.548
explained. "Remember, you have to throw the slime balls to the opposing player and not at the opposing

16
00:01:20.549 --> 00:01:23.471
player. And you must throw

17
00:01:23.472 --> 00:01:30.365
underhand. After two tosses, you will step back and start tossing again. Good

18
00:01:30.366 --> 00:01:36.810
luck!" The first few tosses went

19
00:01:36.811 --> 00:01:40.006
smoothly. Then Pixel missed a toss from

20
00:01:40.007 --> 00:01:45.965
Cleo. The slime ball fell between his hands and crashed onto the ground.

21
00:01:45.966 --> 00:01:50.695
Splat! "You're out, Pixel," Cleo

22
00:01:50.696 --> 00:01:54.371
said. Lon went out next, after a toss from

23
00:01:54.372 --> 00:01:59.493
Ben. "Ick!" the werewolf said as the slime ball exploded on his

24
00:01:59.494 --> 00:02:04.767
snout. Jen took out Gaby as Ben got a new slime ball and faced

25
00:02:04.776 --> 00:02:09.714
Cleo. Meanwhile Mog and Zork were trying hard to knock each other

26
00:02:09.715 --> 00:02:13.773
out. They threw their ball underhand, but their tosses were very

27
00:02:13.774 --> 00:02:17.398
high. And as they played, they argued back and

28
00:02:17.399 --> 00:02:23.284
forth. "I'll get you back for that crack about my tail!" Zork

29
00:02:23.285 --> 00:02:27.712
said. "Only if you don't trip over it!" Mog shot

30
00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:30.999
back. Deb and Carly were tossing to each

31
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:37.672
other. Both doppelgangers had grown giant-size hands that looked like baseball

32
00:02:37.673 --> 00:02:44.069
gloves. Ben tossed the slime ball to Cleo, and then they each took several steps backward

33
00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:47.395
again. "Argh! I'm out!" Mog

34
00:02:47.396 --> 00:02:53.563
cried. The slime ball was caught on one of his horns, and the slime was dripping into his

35
00:02:53.564 --> 00:02:57.987
eyes. "Yes!" Zork dropped to his knees and threw his arms in the

36
00:02:57.988 --> 00:03:01.272
air. Brunhilda had been catching Waldo's

37
00:03:01.273 --> 00:03:09.083
tosses. "Ahh!" She suddenly missed a slime ball, and now her whole face was covered in the gooey stuff.

38
00:03:09.092 --> 00:03:12.900
"I guess Waldo is good at this," Ben thought, watching.

39
00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:18.005
"He has—" Splat! A slime ball slammed Ben in the forehead.

40
00:03:18.006 --> 00:03:27.988
With Ben out, Cleo went to face Waldo, just as Deb missed a low throw and got her legs splattered.

41
00:03:27.989 --> 00:03:33.208
That left Carly waiting for an opponent, but only for a moment.

42
00:03:33.209 --> 00:03:38.471
Splat! Zork stared down at a big slime stain on his belly.

43
00:03:38.472 --> 00:03:42.514
"It's all in the wrist action," Jen boasted.

44
00:03:42.515 --> 00:03:48.889
She picked up a new slime ball and began tossing with Carly.

45
00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:53.066
"Only Waldo and Jen are left from Team Black," Ben thought.

46
00:03:53.067 --> 00:03:56.017
"Can they beat Cleo and Carly?"

47
00:03:56.018 --> 00:04:01.530
For several tosses, no one missed, so no one got slimed.

48
00:04:01.531 --> 00:04:05.952
"C'mon, Team Black! You can do it!" Mog yelled.

49
00:04:05.953 --> 00:04:09.649
"Beat 'em, Team Orange!" Zork shouted back.

50
00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:13.742
"Ahh!" Waldo suddenly scratched his arms and his belly.

51
00:04:13.743 --> 00:04:18.248
"I'm so itchy! It must be the grass from the field."

52
00:04:18.249 --> 00:04:24.587
Cleo tossed the slime ball, which bounced off Waldo's arm and into the grass.

53
00:04:24.588 --> 00:04:27.312
"Yes!" Cleo cheered.

54
00:04:27.313 --> 00:04:30.473
Then Carly let out a startled cry.

55
00:04:30.474 --> 00:04:36.429
"Oh no!" Her slime ball slid from her hand and smashed her right in the mouth.

56
00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:41.170
She licked her lips. "It tastes good though!"

57
00:04:41.171 --> 00:04:46.957
"We've got our finalists—Cleo and Jen!" Mr. Gwarg announced.

58
00:04:46.958 --> 00:04:55.322
He handed a new ball to Cleo, and a hush fell over the crowd as the two monsters began tossing the ball back and forth.

59
00:04:55.323 --> 00:05:01.274
Ben bit a fingernail. Next to him, Deb looked just as nervous.

60
00:05:01.275 --> 00:05:06.876
"If Jen loses," Deb whispered, "Team Orange will win Field Day."

61
00:05:06.877 --> 00:05:09.578
"I know," Ben said grimly.

62
00:05:09.579 --> 00:05:11.707
Cleo tossed the ball again.

63
00:05:11.708 --> 00:05:14.571
This time it soared high into the air.

64
00:05:14.572 --> 00:05:18.320
Jen reached for it, but her arms were short, and . . .

65
00:05:18.321 --> 00:05:24.076
Boink! As the ball hit her head, the crowd gasped.

66
00:05:24.077 --> 00:05:26.263
But the slime ball didn't break.

67
00:05:26.264 --> 00:05:32.694
Instead it sank back down and right into her waiting hands.

68
00:05:32.695 --> 00:05:40.766
Ben laughed. "No wonder she's doing so well in this event. Blobs are soft!"

69
00:05:40.767 --> 00:05:42.923
Jen threw the ball back.

70
00:05:42.924 --> 00:05:47.215
Cleo caught it, but then it slipped from her fingers.

71
00:05:47.216 --> 00:05:51.164
Splat! Slime splashed everywhere.

72
00:05:51.165 --> 00:05:53.475
Mog and Ben bumped chests.

73
00:05:53.476 --> 00:05:56.989
Team Black's fans were going wild.

74
00:05:56.990 --> 00:06:03.220
"Team Black has won the slime ball toss!" Mr. Gwarg called out.

75
00:06:03.221 --> 00:06:13.147
Jen grinned proudly. "It's great to be a blob!"

